      "weight": 0.25,
      "title": "Saturday bus schedule",
      "text_content": "Kipling Station — Saturday Service\n\nBus 44 to Kipling Station: 8:05, 8:20, 8:35, 8:50.\nLast downtown bus: 11:45 pm. After that, use the night bus.\nA transfer is free if you tap your Presto card within two hours.\nPlatform B is for westbound buses. Platform A is closed for repair this weekend.\nNeed milk or bread after your ride? The grocery store is a five-minute walk from the station.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "test-F3-read-q1",
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "question": "What time is the last downtown bus?",
          "options": ["8:05", "8:50", "11:45 pm", "2:00 am"],
          "correct_answer": 2
        },
        {
          "id": "test-F3-read-q2",
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "question": "Which platform is closed this weekend?",
          "options": ["Platform B", "Platform A", "Platform C", "All platforms"],
          "correct_answer": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "test-F3-read-q3",
          "type": "multiple_choice",
          "question": "How do you get a free transfer?",
          "options": [
            "Ask the grocery clerk",
            "Tap your Presto card within two hours",
            "Pay cash a second time",
            "Wait on Platform A"
          ],
          "correct_answer": 1
        },
        {
          "id": "test-F3-read-q4",
          "type": "fill_blank",
          "question": "Westbound buses use platform ____.",
          "correct_answer": "B",
          "accepted_answers": ["b", "Platform B", "platform b"]
